{"id":"h17j5tzoapsrn34edjeh6app5","title":"道库恰耶夫的土壤形成方程","originalTitle":"道库恰耶夫（В. В. Докучаев）的土壤形成方程","summary":"1883 年，道库恰耶夫在其著作《俄罗斯黑钙土》中提出，黑钙土的形成是气候、植被、地形和母岩共同作用的结果。1899 年，他在另一文中进一步指出，土壤是气候、生物和母岩的函数，即 П=f(К, О, Г)，强调了土壤年龄对比较的重要性。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=55413&do=blog&id=1561826"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T06:38:23.487Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T06:38:23.487Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["论文发表"],"score":28,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}